{
  "format": "a2game-capability",
  "manifestVersion": "0.1.0",
  "id": "a2game.strategy.tower-defense",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "kind": "behavior",
  "portability": "exact",
  "description": "Integer fixed-Tick placement, path waves, tower merge/replacement, owned weapons and rewards. No game-name branches or host-side gameplay.",
  "phase": "simulate",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "id": "a2game.core.state",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2game.strategy.tower",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2game.strategy.range",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2game.strategy.placement-grid",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2game.strategy.cost",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2game.strategy.reward",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2game.combat.wave",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2game.combat.cooldown",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2game.combat.damage",
      "version": "0.1.0"
    }
  ],
  "contract": {
    "configSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "statePath": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^/"
        },
        "width": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 256,
          "maximum": 32000
        },
        "height": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 256,
          "maximum": 32000
        },
        "cost": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 1000000
        },
        "damage": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 1000
        },
        "range": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 16,
          "maximum": 64000
        },
        "speed": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 128
        },
        "cooldownTicks": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 600
        },
        "maxTicks": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 1000000
        },
        "cells": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "x": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 100,
                "maximum": 31900
              },
              "y": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 100,
                "maximum": 31900
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "x",
              "y"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 16
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "x": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 100,
                "maximum": 31900
              },
              "y": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 100,
                "maximum": 31900
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "x",
              "y"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "minItems": 2,
          "maxItems": 64
        },
        "waves": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "tick": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 1000000
              },
              "hp": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 1000000
              },
              "reward": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 1000000
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "tick",
              "hp",
              "reward"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 32
        },
        "actions": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "action": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 64
              },
              "kind": {
                "enum": [
                  "place",
                  "select",
                  "merge",
                  "upgrade"
                ]
              },
              "index": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 15,
                "description": "Every command kind requires index < config.cells.length, not merely <=15. Invalid values fail admission."
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "action",
              "kind",
              "index"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 64
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "statePath",
        "width",
        "height",
        "cost",
        "damage",
        "range",
        "speed",
        "cooldownTicks",
        "maxTicks",
        "cells",
        "path",
        "waves",
        "actions"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "stateSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "wallet": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1000000000
        },
        "score": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1000000000
        },
        "nextId": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1000000000
        },
        "lives": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1000
        },
        "selected": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": -1,
          "maximum": 15
        },
        "waveCursor": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 32
        },
        "towers": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,48}$"
              },
              "cell": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 15,
                "description": "Must be less than config.cells.length; one tower per cell."
              },
              "level": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 8
              },
              "weaponId": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,48}$"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "id",
              "cell",
              "level",
              "weaponId"
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 16
        },
        "weapons": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,48}$"
              },
              "owner": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,48}$"
              },
              "nextFire": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 1000000600
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "id",
              "owner",
              "nextFire"
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 16
        },
        "enemies": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,48}$"
              },
              "x": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 100,
                "maximum": 31900
              },
              "y": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 100,
                "maximum": 31900
              },
              "hp": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 1000000
              },
              "cursor": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 64
              },
              "reward": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 1000000
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "id",
              "x",
              "y",
              "hp",
              "cursor",
              "reward"
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 32
        },
        "bodies": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,48}$"
              },
              "kind": {
                "enum": [
                  "actor",
                  "target"
                ]
              },
              "x": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 100,
                "maximum": 31900
              },
              "y": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 100,
                "maximum": 31900
              },
              "hx": {
                "const": 150
              },
              "hy": {
                "const": 150
              },
              "value": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 1000000
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "id",
              "kind",
              "x",
              "y",
              "hx",
              "hy",
              "value"
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 48
        },
        "shots": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "owner": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,48}$"
              },
              "weapon": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,48}$"
              },
              "target": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,48}$"
              },
              "tick": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 1000000000
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "owner",
              "weapon",
              "target",
              "tick"
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 16
        },
        "won": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "lost": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "wallet",
        "score",
        "nextId",
        "lives",
        "selected",
        "waveCursor",
        "towers",
        "weapons",
        "enemies",
        "bodies",
        "shots",
        "won",
        "lost"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "All listed fields must be initialized explicitly; no automatic state initialization. Bounds depending on config and ownership relations are checked semantically. Additional state fields are preserved."
    },
    "commands": [],
    "events": [
      {
        "name": "defense.placed",
        "payloadSchema": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "defense.changed",
        "payloadSchema": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "defense.invalid",
        "payloadSchema": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "defense.merged",
        "payloadSchema": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "defense.wave",
        "payloadSchema": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "defense.escaped",
        "payloadSchema": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "defense.fired",
        "payloadSchema": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "defense.reward",
        "payloadSchema": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    ],
    "stateWrites": [
      "global"
    ],
    "lifecycle": [
      "initialize",
      "tick",
      "pause",
      "resume",
      "reset",
      "dispose"
    ]
  },
  "limits": {
    "maxTowers": 16,
    "maxEnemies": 32,
    "maxWaves": 32,
    "maxWaypoints": 64,
    "maxLevel": 8,
    "unitsPerMeter": 1000,
    "maxMovementPerTick": 128,
    "clock": "shared Tick; commands before combat rewards; merge inherits later cooldown; never reuse object IDs"
  },
  "testSuites": [
    "DEFENSE-OWNERSHIP-001",
    "COVERAGE-G21-POSITIVE",
    "COVERAGE-H01-POSITIVE"
  ],
  "extensions": {
    "publicSemantics": {
      "scope": "PUBLIC_MECHANISM_CONTRACT_NOT_LEVEL_OR_SOLUTION",
      "initialization": {
        "template": {
          "wallet": "<author-chosen integer 0..1000000000>",
          "score": 0,
          "lives": "<author-chosen integer 0..1000>",
          "nextId": 0,
          "selected": -1,
          "waveCursor": 0,
          "towers": [],
          "weapons": [],
          "enemies": [],
          "bodies": [],
          "shots": [],
          "won": false,
          "lost": false
        },
        "note": "Template placeholders are explanatory, not executable GameSpec. Existing helper defaults wallet=4/lives=3 are not injected into JSON; provide values explicitly."
      },
      "crossFieldInvariants": "Tower cells/action.index must be < cells.length (all action kinds, including merge/select); unique tower cells and IDs; one unique weapon per tower, matching tower.weaponId and weapon.owner. Enemies use unique live IDs, hp>0, cursor 1..path.length; waveCursor<=waves.length. Points fit [100,width-100] and [100,height-100]. waves sorted by tick, each tick<=maxTicks. All configured actions reference declared button actions.",
      "tickOrder": "Press commands in input order -> due waves spawn -> path movement/escapes -> weapons -> rewards/dead removal -> won/lost and body projection. shots is cleared each tick. Same-tick combat rewards cannot fund earlier commands.",
      "placeUpgrade": "place requires empty indexed cell and wallet>=cost; creates level1 tower/owned weapon and deducts cost. upgrade requires existing tower, level<8, wallet>=cost*currentLevel; deducts that amount and increments level without replacing weapon or resetting cooldown. Invalid commands emit defense.invalid; the realtime tick may still advance enemies/combat, so whole-state equality is not an invalid-purchase invariant.",
      "merge": "select sets the occupied source cell. merge at distinct target requires equal levels below8; removes both towers and owned weapons, creates a new tower/weapon at target with level+1 and new IDs, resets selected=-1. New nextFire=max(currentTick,both retired cooldowns). Merge has no wallet cost. Retired weapons cannot fire after replacement.",
      "combat": "Enemies move x then y with speed Manhattan-unit budget toward next waypoint; reaching path end removes enemy and deducts one life (clamped at0). Towers process lexical ID order; targets are living in Manhattan range, nearest first then lexical enemy ID. Damage=damage*2^(level-1); successful fire sets nextFire=currentTick+cooldownTicks. Kill rewards wallet once and increments score once; hp0 enemies excluded from later targeting and removed.",
      "outcome": "lost=(lives===0 || tickIndex>=maxTicks). won=(!lost && waveCursor===waves.length && enemies.length===0). These flags need explicit GameSpec outcomes to set Runtime flow. Winning with a merged tower is not proof that merging was necessary.",
      "presentation": "bodies is runtime-owned read-only projection: towers kind actor/value 2^level; enemies kind target/value hp, hx=hy=150. bodyLayer.statePath is /<stateField>/bodies, not the object statePath or /state/<stateField>/bodies. Body styles are conditional presentation capabilities; see host-profile scene2d.bodyLayer."
    }
  }
}
